{"id":243360,"shortDescription":"TrackMania² Valley is the third environment of TrackMania², the sequel to Nadeo Studio’s online racing phenomenon TrackMania, already enjoyed by millions of players. Valley is a new take on the classic arcade rally racing genre. Flirting between arcade and simulation, Valley marks a new checkpoint in the history of racing games.","developers":["Nadeo"],"publishers":["Ubisoft"],"categories":["Un jugador","Multijugador","Compatibilidad con RV","Steam Workshop","Compat. parcial con mando","Incluye editor de niveles","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"4 JUL 2013","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/243360?t=1680016531","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/243360/ss_acc223a1dca98be9e49a4c8e6e9e199697ad3a26.600x338.jpg?t=1680016531","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/243360/ss_acc223a1dca98be9e49a4c8e6e9e199697ad3a26.1920x1080.jpg?t=1680016531"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/243360/ss_91fd92e570d106d38476d30941d701e700cf87d5.600x338.jpg?t=1680016531","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/243360/ss_91fd92e570d106d38476d30941d701e700cf87d5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1680016531"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/243360/ss_cf949d073a996a6fa57c219879fded95d3d180c2.600x338.jpg?t=1680016531","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/243360/ss_cf949d073a996a6fa57c219879fded95d3d180c2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1680016531"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/243360/ss_6d58af56dc6087809f091cf1a9f7bffead4f00ef.600x338.jpg?t=1680016531","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/243360/ss_6d58af56dc6087809f091cf1a9f7bffead4f00ef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1680016531"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic